owc.dat     OWC             Original working curve lookup table path
LINEAR      WCType          Working curve formula: LINEAR, QUADRATIC, or EXP
2.338e8     k1              First parameter defining the working curve shape
0.0         k2              Second parameter defining the working curve shape
TRUE        DualDamping     Use adaptive slow spring damping based on a target period; if true, the BA in the Line TYPES section will NOT be used
1.0e11      OWCDamping      Static damping for the original working curve; used when DualDamping=True; BA field in the main moordyn input file will be omiited
8.0e11      WCDamping       Static damping for the working curve; used when DualDamping=True; BA_D field in the main moordyn input file will be omiited
1.0e-5      DampingRatio    The fast spring dampint relative to the slow spring damping, for numerical stability, usually small; used when DualDamping=True